2 0 obj
<<
/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (Microfluidics\040for\040Synthetic\040Biology\072\040From\040Design\040to\040Execution)
/Author (Mike\040Ferry\054\040Ivan\040Razinkov\054\040Jeff\040Hasty)
/Subject (With\040the\040expanding\040interest\040in\040cellular\040responses\040to\040dynamic\040environments\054\040microfluidic\040devices\040have\040become\040important\040experimental\040platforms\040for\040biological\040research\056\040Microfluidic\040\042microchemostat\042\040devices\040enable\040precise\040environmental\040control\040while\040capturing\040high\040quality\054\040single\055cell\040gene\040expression\040data\056\040For\040studies\040of\040population\040heterogeneity\040and\040gene\040expression\040noise\054\040these\040abilities\040are\040crucial\056\040Here\054\040we\040describe\040the\040necessary\040steps\040for\040experimental\040microfluidics\040using\040devices\040created\040in\040our\040lab\040as\040examples\056\040First\054\040we\040discuss\040the\040rational\040design\040of\040microchemostats\040and\040the\040tools\040available\040to\040predict\040their\040performance\056\040We\040carefully\040analyze\040the\040critical\040parts\040of\040an\040example\040device\054\040focusing\040on\040the\040most\040important\040part\040of\040any\040microchemostat\072\040the\040cell\040trap\056\040Next\054\040we\040present\040a\040method\040for\040generating\040on\055chip\040dynamic\040environments\040using\040an\040integrated\040fluidic\040junction\040coupled\040to\040linear\040actuators\056\040Our\040system\040relies\040on\040the\040simple\040modulation\040of\040hydrostatic\040pressure\040to\040alter\040the\040mixing\040ratio\040between\040two\040source\040reservoirs\040and\040we\040detail\040the\040software\040and\040hardware\040behind\040it\056\040To\040expand\040the\040throughput\040of\040microchemostat\040experiments\054\040we\040describe\040how\040to\040build\040larger\054\040parallel\040versions\040of\040simpler\040devices\056\040To\040analyze\040the\040large\040amounts\040of\040data\054\040we\040discuss\040methods\040for\040automated\040cell\040tracking\054\040focusing\040on\040the\040special\040problems\040presented\040by\040Saccharomyces\040cerevisiae\040cells\056\040The\040manufacturing\040of\040microchemostats\040is\040described\040in\040complete\040detail\072\040from\040the\040photolithographic\040processing\040of\040the\040wafer\040to\040the\040final\040bonding\040of\040the\040PDMS\040chip\040to\040glass\040coverslip\056\040Finally\054\040the\040procedures\040for\040conducting\040Escherichia\040coli\040and\040S\056\040cerevisiae\040microchemostat\040experiments\040are\040addressed\056)
/Keywords (01\040Jan\0402011\054\040Methods\040in\040Enzymology\054\040Hydrostatic\040pressure\054\040University\040of\040California\054\040San\040Diego)
>>
endobj
